caption: Universal Origin Rule
tradition-component: universal-origin-rule

Before Mastery, all non-Talent traits purchased through Dreadhound require both Psionic, -10%, and Super, -10%, and remain subject to the Eldritch Gifts Core rules. Power Talents themselves do not take those source modifiers.
